1a-2e2e-4881-a1fd-c457bf1d29a3" class="r-vshp3p alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What are the best practices in using these shower tablets?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d1bb7ea8-0f39-4663-a130-90e2319f1936" class="r-yqla4r" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-vhijsh" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2nj2:"><div data-rid="7e878613-1fab-4b03-a341-afbf72f4bd1e" class="r-9wd0cn"><div data-rid="64e0da72-507b-4063-9620-5332cef4d561" class="r-nkdto6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We recommend to use one tablet per shower or two tablets to double the strength if needed. Use in hot shower and make sure it’s not submerged in water but rather placed under the shower stream of hot water.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="d6f0135e-5d4e-48f7-87cd-3c0370c34312" class="r-1pkhdmc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="dc8fb615-6c45-48c4-888a-7d619295e6c5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3nj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-yppy98"><div data-rid="2e098920-e51d-4d3c-b308-27e314e4dd18" class="r-13ft6s9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3</p></span></div><div data-rid="edba068f-d693-4acd-935b-49fa99b68253" class="r-11av6dy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Will these tablets make floor slippery and create stains/drain clogs</p></span></div><div data-rid="3f46a705-77e9-459a-b271-c4ae08fd8028" class="r-1si2cqf" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-wfomqa" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R3nj2:"><div data-rid="b537959e-eb81-438c-b197-22673d6c7d71" class="r-6gbfs4"><div data-rid="45aec890-cdf7-4223-8581-71038a63fdf5" class="r-12nco14 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>These shower tablets will not make the floor slippery and unlike other brands with petals, it will dissolve smoothly to create a no mess, no drain clog experience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="990c7b9a-94f7-4644-9f36-4745073a530f" class="r-p1et4g" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3193f34c-584e-41c2-8f4c-56a359ac880f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R4nj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1l5b7od"><div data-rid="472201c7-904c-46b8-810b-a9d8e3fdf5ec" class="r-o5b7pg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>4</p></span></div><div data-rid="03ee6549-2446-4032-92a8-790a61479f22" class="r-1m0rh9h alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can these shower tablets be used as a bath bombs?</p></span></div><div data-rid="810e7543-1348-4722-9805-ffc98d3f30a8" class="r-vwfl9l" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1s5joz7" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R4nj2:"><div data-rid="80979350-bb05-421f-a705-4852cc8239e2" class="r-1ps8mgl"><div data-rid="6484e53a-fe55-4c6e-81c0-2ae15d5b3548" class="r-yrv81j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We do not recommend these used as bath bombs. These tablets work best when not submerged in water, making it perfect for the shower experience. However, you can place the shower tablet on the side of the bath tub and it will activate the aromatherapy with a sprinkle of water contact.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="9bdadf55-9f60-46d0-a046-6796d2728987" class="r-zt5o0b" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9de75930-5fd7-42da-92c6-999b01131a62" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5nj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1lwfsd0"><div data-rid="f3240429-d5d1-4e13-ba1e-50de42e75669" class="r-q38hxw alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5</p></span></div><div data-rid="bc84d6d1-1f02-4112-9595-89d8ace86a96" class="r-et8bjk alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do these shower tablets have a shelf life?</p></span></div><div data-rid="3a202605-b5a8-43a1-92c8-cc7f7eef5555" class="r-1fn3rw" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1hn7siq" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R5nj2:"><div data-rid="9947d08b-b2f2-41d5-9e27-509b14d7119e" class="r-12oefzq"><div data-rid="4bc70b1f-32ad-44c6-b186-f320c941ab6f" class="r-1hbddjn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>These shower tablets are individually foil wrapped to ensure maximum shelf life. We recommend using the shower steamers within a year for the best experience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4f146c8f-eead-4e6a-9839-e1f83298e995" class="r-14v9yoc" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7a5ae